1
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,640
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,710
=Episode 21=

3
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,720
(His Majesty will never kill me!)

4
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:17,000
Consort Qi.

5
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,720
What is your intent?

6
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,120
The lovers' knot is broken.

7
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,160
Doesn't that mean...

8
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:27,040
Someone deliberately broke
their vow of eternal love?

9
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,240
Its sudden severing signals

10
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:30,840
the end of their bond.

11
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,280
Concubine Rou.

12
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,840
What nonsense are you talking about?

13
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:39,920
Your Majesty.

14
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,040
The late Empress and I
were like sisters.

15
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,720
Why would I deliberately destroy

16
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,040
the vow you shared with her,
Your Majesty?

17
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,120
Guards!

18
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,360
Consort Rong failed in her duty.

19
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:52,120
Consort Qi destroyed the lover's knot
by mishandling it.

20
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,840
It's an insult to the late Empress.

21
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:55,560
Take them both away.

22
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:56,640
Thirty strokes of the cane each!

23
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:57,960
Yes.

24
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,280
Wait!

25
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:02,000
Your Majesty.

26
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,320
I beg leave to speak.

27
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,480
I beseech you to judge fairly!

28
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,440
Speak.

29
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:08,120
Consort Qi keeps saying

30
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:10,200
she and the late Empress
were like sisters.

31
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,600
If that were true,

32
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,280
why wouldn't the late Empress bless

33
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:14,680
this memorial so it would go smoothly?

34
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,120
What happened today...

35
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,160
To me,

36
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,720
it looks like the late Empress's spirit

37
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:20,760
sending a sign.

38
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:23,200
Perhaps she suffered some injustice

39
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:24,320
and wants Your Majesty

40
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,560
to clear her name.

41
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,320
Your Majesty.

42
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,280
I admit my fault, Your Majesty!

43
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,640
I didn't mean to break it!

44
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:33,440
My sister loved me dearly.

45
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,800
If she were still alive,

46
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,800
even if I'd damaged her things,

47
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,560
she would surely forgive me.

48
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,080
She'd never blame me.

49
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,120
Your Majesty...

50
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,800
Please forgive me, Your Majesty!

51
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,160
If I've angered Your Majesty,

52
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:47,280
I'll gladly take thirty strokes.

53
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:48,240
I...

54
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,800
I'll accept my punishment now.

55
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:50,600
Stop right there.

56
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:52,640
Your Majesty.

57
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:55,000
Since the late Empress has sent a sign,

58
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:56,320
there is

59
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:57,720
one more thing

60
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:58,920
I must report.

61
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,320
What is it?

62
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,960
Do you remember, Your Majesty,

63
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,160
that I was poisoned with red alum?

64
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,880
The Imperial Hospital
treated me with all its skill.

65
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,880
During my treatment,

66
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:11,680
I happened to obtain

67
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,200
the late Empress's

68
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,360
medical records from before she passed.

69
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:18,440
There was something strange
about those records.

70
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,680
Impossible.

71
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,640
The Empress's and Dowager's records

72
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,240
should be sealed by
the Imperial Hospital

73
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,920
and the Imperial Household.

74
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,040
Without my decree,

75
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,120
no one may touch them.

76
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,200
How did you get them?

77
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,520
I dare not conceal anything.

78
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,200
These records

79
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:34,400
hold the secret of
the late Empress's death.

80
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,920
They were secretly kept by

81
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,600
the former Director Li

82
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,760
of the Imperial Hospital.

83
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:41,080
Physician Li can testify to this.

84
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,200
Summon Physician Li.

85
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:47,440
Summon Physician Li.

86
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,640
Your Majesty.

87
00:02:58,920 --> 00:02:59,720
Physician Li.

88
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,920
Did you give Consort Rong

89
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:03,640
the late Empress's medical records?

90
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:08,360
Your Majesty.

91
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:10,200
Every word Consort Rong said is true.

92
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,320
The late Empress's records

93
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,800
were indeed swapped.

94
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,600
I dared to investigate in secret

95
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,560
and discovered

96
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:17,000
it was my father's doing.

97
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,160
This is a grave matter.

98
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,560
I didn't dare decide on my own,

99
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,240
so I gave them to Consort Rong

100
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:23,000
to present to you when the time came.

101
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:24,320
Present them.

102
00:03:31,958 --> 00:03:33,560
(Spring, Year 15 of Yongqing
Empress Yang, age 24)

103
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,000
Insolence!

104
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,000
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

105
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,520
Guards.

106
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,440
Bring Li Yuan here!

107
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:05,960
Greetings.

108
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,640
Your Majesty.

109
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,200
Li Yuan.

110
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,200
Tell me everything

111
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,360
you know. Leave nothing out.

112
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,240
I am guilty...

113
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,080
Your Majesty.

114
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,560
Back then,

115
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,440
when the late Empress died suddenly,

116
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,680
I had already noticed something amiss.

117
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,600
Someone had

118
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:35,040
swapped her asthma medicine

119
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,480
for a toxic substance, henbane,

120
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,480
which worsened her condition.

121
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:41,440
But just then,

122
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,240
Consort Qi

123
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,360
came to me in private,

124
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,560
probing with veiled words

125
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:51,600
and threatening my whole family's lives.

126
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,400
That's when I realized

127
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,280
this was no accident.

128
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,760
There had to be more to it.

129
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,200
So, to protect myself,

130
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,760
I claimed illness and
retired to my hometown.

131
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,240
But...

132
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,880
Before I left,

133
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:08,720
I secretly took the late Empress's
medical records.

134
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:11,480
I wanted to preserve a chance to

135
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,000
uncover the truth behind her death.

136
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,600
Your Majesty.

137
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:15,920
I...

138
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,080
I deserve death.

139
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:21,800
Consort Qi...

140
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:25,880
You were the person my mother
and I trusted most in the palace.

141
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,240
I once suspected my mother's death

142
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,480
wasn't as simple as it seemed.

143
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,320
But I never thought

144
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,680
that you, who raised me day and night,

145
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:36,560
were the one who killed my mother!

146
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:42,720
Your Majesty.

147
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,120
I'm innocent, Your Majesty!

148
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,760
I'm innocent!

149
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:48,520
I would never betray the late Empress!

150
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,120
I'm innocent, Your Majesty!

151
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,320
I didn't do it!

152
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,480
It wasn't me!

153
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,000
No...

154
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,080
By my decree.

155
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,120
Li Yuan,

156
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,520
aiding the wicked

157
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,280
and concealing a grave crime.

158
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,440
Yet, considering

159
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,080
that he retained some conscience

160
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,360
and preserved the evidence,

161
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:07,840
from this day forward,

162
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:08,840
he's struck from the medical rolls

163
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:10,120
and barred from service for life.

164
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,880
His son, Li Chengyan,

165
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:13,960
merits a reward exposing the truth.

166
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,360
Past faults are pardoned.

167
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,480
He is promoted to

168
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,240
deputy director
of the Imperial Hospital.

169
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:20,760
- Your Majesty...
- Your Majesty...

170
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,960
- Thank you for your grace!
- Thank you for your grace!

171
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,240
Consort Qi.

172
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:27,320
From this day forward,

173
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:28,840
you are demoted to Concubine.

174
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,400
You will remain confined
to Zhongning Palace.

175
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,000
Once the case of
the late Empress's death

176
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,800
has been fully investigated,

177
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,560
you will be punished further.

178
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:38,880
Yes.

179
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:42,920
Thank you for your mercy, Your Majesty.

180
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,440
(Doesn't His Majesty love
the late Empress?)

181
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:48,920
(Consort Qi did something
so outrageous.)

182
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,800
(Why didn't he punish her?)

183
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,680
(Only a demotion?)

184
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:54,680
(Fu Rong.)

185
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,160
(Didn't see that coming, did you?)

186
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,400
(No matter how you scheme,)

187
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,240
(I still have a way out.)

188
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,040
(You don't know this, do you?)

189
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:05,560
(My father once saved
His Majesty's life.)

190
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,040
(His Majesty will never kill me!)

191
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,720
That wretch!

192
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,840
Why is she so hard to deal with?

193
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,720
I meant to use the late Empress's
belongings

194
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:22,680
and His Majesty's hand

195
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,920
to crush her.

196
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:27,160
But she turned my plan against me,

197
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,640
costing me His Majesty's trust.

198
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,960
All these years of endurance,

199
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:34,440
all my careful scheming,

200
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,720
she's ruined it all!

201
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:36,920
Calm down, Your Highness.

202
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,320
What should we do now?

203
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:45,040
Now I've lost the eldest prince's trust.

204
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:47,480
I can't lose Princess Xihe too.

205
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,800
She's all I have left to rely on.

206
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:54,320
Tomorrow, go bring Princess Xihe

207
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,600
back from the Imperial residence early.

208
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,960
Yes, Your Highness.

209
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,720
Our Princess Xihe

210
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:02,600
is His Majesty's favorite
among all the princesses.

211
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,160
With her by your side,

212
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,520
you'll still have influence

213
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:07,760
and a chance to regain his favor.

214
00:08:13,176 --> 00:08:15,069
(Xihe, Consort Qi's daughter)

215
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,400
At today's banquet,

216
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,440
I had the Imperial Kitchen

217
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,680
make sweet fermented rice.

218
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,280
It's a dessert from Jiangnan.

219
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:24,640
Make yourselves comfortable.

220
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,480
Do have some.

221
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,840
Thank you, Your Majesty.

222
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:34,320
It's delicious! So sweet!

223
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,880
This honey is much sweeter
than the sweets at the residence.

224
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,680
If you like it, have some more.

225
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:40,640
Jinxuan.

226
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:45,320
Why can sister Xihe drink it

227
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,520
and I can't?

228
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,560
Did you forget?

229
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,880
You just got over your cough.

230
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:50,960
The physician said

231
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,160
you must avoid sweets.

232
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:54,240
But I'm not coughing anymore.

233
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,280
I'm fully recovered.

234
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,280
Even so, you can't have it right away.

235
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,120
Consort Rong.

236
00:08:58,560 --> 00:08:59,720
Jinxuan is still young.

237
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,840
Why be so strict with her?

238
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:03,280
Children...

239
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,800
They all love sweet fermented rice.

240
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,280
As a mother,

241
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:08,040
you shouldn't be so hard on her.

242
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:10,680
This lily and pear soup suits you.

243
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:11,920
Here, try some.

244
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,120
I don't want it.

245
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:15,040
You control everything I do.

246
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,400
I can't even have one sip

247
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,520
without your permission.

248
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:18,880
I hate it!

249
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,480
Where are you going?

250
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:28,920
Mother.

251
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,480
What's wrong?

252
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:32,720
Nothing.

253
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,280
Princess, please don't be upset.

254
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,600
Let's go back.

255
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,440
Leave me alone.

256
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,040
Or I'll get punished again.

257
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,320
Princess.

258
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,080
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

259
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,040
You two may leave.

260
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:53,960
- Yes.
- Yes.

261
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,200
Jinxuan.

262
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:06,760
Consort Rong only wants
what's best for you.

263
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,200
Everything's for my good.

264
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,680
Did she ever ask my opinion?

265
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,840
My mother never controlled me like this.

266
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:12,880
True.

267
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,720
Your mother, Zhaoyi Shen,
loved you dearly.

268
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:18,720
She always saved the best for you.

269
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,080
They say

270
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:22,560
a child is her mother's flesh and blood.

271
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,400
No matter how kind others seem,

272
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,440
their affection may be superficial.

273
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,040
Hearts are hard to read.

274
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,840
But...

275
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,160
Everyone in the palace

276
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:34,680
says my mother is bad,

277
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,040
that she's a wicked woman.

278
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,920
Who told you such nonsense?

279
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:40,240
Your mother was a good person.

280
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:42,040
She may have seemed spoiled,

281
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,680
but she had a kind heart

282
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:44,880
and was sincere to others.

283
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,320
But...

284
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:50,520
Aren't Consort Rong and my mother
always at odds?

285
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,360
Many people in the palace say

286
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:55,840
my mother helped Noble Consort Hui
bully others

287
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:56,920
and hurt Consort Rong.

288
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,880
They say she deserved to die.

289
00:10:59,120 --> 00:10:59,920
Nonsense.

290
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,720
Where did you hear that?

291
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,520
Rumors in this harem are terrifying.

292
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:07,480
A lie repeated often

293
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,160
becomes accepted as truth.

294
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:15,840
Jinxuan.

295
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:18,160
Your mother wasn't that kind of person.

296
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,320
The truly wicked one is...

297
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,800
Who? Consort Qi?

298
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:26,120
Consort Qi, please tell me!

299
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,760
Please...

300
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,040
I beg you.

301
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,800
The feud between Consort Rong
and Noble Consort Hui

302
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,960
nearly cost your mother her life.

303
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:39,000
To protect you,

304
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,440
she had to bear the blame

305
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,600
and accept her fate.

306
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,400
That's why your mother

307
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,840
died so tragically in the cold palace.

308
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:50,360
So my mother wasn't the bad one.

309
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:51,840
Consort Rong was.

310
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,040
You're back.

311
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:06,040
How did my mother die?

312
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:08,640
Did you kill her?

313
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,720
Princess Jinxuan.

314
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,960
Don't be rude to Her Highness.

315
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,080
She knew you hadn't eaten dinner,

316
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:17,040
so she saved you food.

317
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:17,760
Go away!

318
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:19,320
Jinxuan.

319
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,400
Why won't you answer me?

320
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:21,280
Feeling guilty?

321
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:25,120
Why ask me this all of a sudden?

322
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:26,960
Did someone say something to you?

323
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,360
Was it you?

324
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,360
Did you send her to the cold palace?

325
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:31,960
Did you drive her to drown herself?

326
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:32,760
Didn't you?

327
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,160
Jinxuan...

328
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,360
You're still young.

329
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,200
You don't understand.

330
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:40,800
When you're older,

331
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:42,920
I'll tell you everything.

332
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:45,440
How dare you!

333
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,960
You're guilty. I know it!

334
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,440
You killed my mother!

335
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:53,280
Why won't you tell me the truth?

336
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:55,880
I don't need your fake kindness.

337
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:58,640
I won't eat your food.

338
00:12:58,640 --> 00:12:59,960
You evil woman!

339
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,560
Princess...

340
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:02,080
Jinxuan!

341
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:02,520
Princess!

342
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,160
Follow the princess!

343
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:05,080
- Yes.
- Yes.

344
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,000
Your Highness.

345
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,320
Why didn't you

346
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,440
tell her the truth?

347
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,240
She's still too young.

348
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:17,680
She wouldn't understand.

349
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:19,160
Besides,

350
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,520
the dead can't testify.

351
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:21,840
It can't be explained.

352
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:25,200
Jinxuan's accusations today must be

353
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:27,480
the result of someone's
deliberate meddling.

354
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,240
In such matters,

355
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,240
defending yourself won't help.

356
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,680
We must strike back.

357
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,400
Your Highness.

358
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,480
It must be Consort Qi again.

359
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,080
For the next few days,

360
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,400
take good care of the princess.

361
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:43,040
I'll see for myself

362
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,880
what she's plotting this time.

363
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:46,960
Yes.

364
00:13:57,683 --> 00:14:02,323
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

365
00:14:02,693 --> 00:14:07,173
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

366
00:14:07,603 --> 00:14:11,883
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

367
00:14:12,323 --> 00:14:16,803
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

368
00:14:17,243 --> 00:14:21,563
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

369
00:14:22,143 --> 00:14:26,603
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

370
00:14:26,943 --> 00:14:31,403
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

371
00:14:31,823 --> 00:14:36,323
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

372
00:14:36,613 --> 00:14:41,083
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

373
00:14:41,663 --> 00:14:44,600
♪Let the stars and sea♪

374
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,000
(Changsheng Gate)

375
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:50,000
♪Wait for your return♪
